<title>UK: BNP sets warrants on Lagardere. [CORRECTED 08:50 GMT]</title>
<headline>BNP sets warrants on Lagardere. [CORRECTED 08:50 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banque Nationale de Paris (Luxembourg) said it has issued 7.5 million American-style call warrants, on Lagardere shares.</p>
<p>One share is controlled by 10 (corrects from 100) warrants.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    110 PCT OF MARKET VALUE</p>
<p> GEARING	   5.50 X		    PREMIUM	1.82 PCT</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	30.JUL.99		 PAYDATE	05.SEP.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   PARIS/LUXEMBOURG	MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
